@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>FoodSupply uses essential cookies for sign-in, form security, and temporary status messages. Sign-in cookies are protected from JavaScript access and sent over HTTPS in production.</p>
<p>Remember me keeps your sign-in cookie after the browser closes. Sign-in lasts 8 hours and may renew while you use the app. Without Remember me, the sign-in cookie is a browser session cookie. Signing out removes the sign-in cookie.</p>
<p>You can remove cookies in your browser settings. Blocking essential cookies prevents sign-in and form submissions from working.</p>
